              "hideComponent": "false",
              "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
              "text": "<h1><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Sage oral solutions and mouth moisturizers</span></span></span></h1>\n<h2>Implementing an effective oral cleansing protocol is essential for all your patients.</h2>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Our solutions and moisturizers are designed to help you keep patients’ mouths clean and moisturized. They promote consistent oral cleansing practices and can improve patient satisfaction and cater to their oral healthcare needs.</span></span></p>\n",
              "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Aug 27 2024 20:08:53 GMT+0000",
              "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
